allACMBetti -- lists all Betti tables of ACM curves with a given Hilbert function
*********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        L = allACMBetti gamma
  * Inputs:
      * gamma, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, positive character
  * Outputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of BettiTally

Description
===========

Given a positive character, it outputs all possible Betti tables of ACM curves
that have this character as its postulation character.
+---------------------------------+
|i1 : allACMBetti {-1,-1,-1,2,1}  |
|                                 |
|             0 1 2         0 1 2 |
|o1 = {total: 1 3 2, total: 1 4 3}|
|          0: 1 . .      0: 1 . . |
|          1: . . .      1: . . . |
|          2: . 3 1      2: . 3 2 |
|          3: . . 1      3: . 1 1 |
|                                 |
|o1 : List                        |
+---------------------------------+

Ways to use allACMBetti:
========================

  * "allACMBetti(List)"

