CubicSurface -- type of HashTable
*********************************

Description
===========

CubicSurface is a type of HashTable storing information about a smooth cubic
surface in P^3. The keys of a QuadricSurface are: IntersectionPairing,
HyperplaneClass, CanonicalClass, Ideal, BlowUpPoints, MapToP3.

Methods that use an object of class CubicSurface:
=================================================

  * "divisor(List,CubicSurface)" -- see *note divisor: divisor, -- creates a
    Divisor
  * "ideal(CubicSurface)" -- see *note ideal(QuadricSurface):
    ideal_lpQuadricSurface_rp, -- extracts the ideal of a surface
  * *note net(CubicSurface): net_lpCubicSurface_rp, -- displays the ideal of
    the CubicSurface
